---

The largest part of rstd is `linalg`: a Zig-native, column-major BLAS and LAPACK, with the best open source method for each routine ported into Zig and results that are bit-identical for any thread count.

Beside it are `rgl` (fonts, text layout and shaders), and smaller pieces for cryptography, zip archives, compound files, logging and build helpers. zfls and RandyOS both build on it.
